es":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","review_id":"X8uKrhGBGUUoAo5owwLyEg","date":"2017-03-27T15:45:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9441611170768738,"text_excerpt":"We are still talking about that frozen Irish coffee. Theirs has the best flavor and presentation. People may argue that there's not a lot of alcohol in it, but let's be honest -- most of us make our way UP Bourbon Street to get here. Having a little less alcohol is probably for the best. (But order the large -- unless you're truly teetering on the edge!) The atmosphere here is fun. It gets crowded, but the bartenders see you and will serve you as soon as they can breathe. If you're lucky enough to grab a spot at the bar, do it. Otherwise, you can take it around with you to go. They have a fun window, too, where half of your party can sit indoors and the other half can sit outdoors. (I saw..."},{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","review_id":"gCQnUWuOaFt3oaOLcWJmug","date":"2011-11-07T22:22:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9395430088043213,"text_excerpt":"Absolutely love this place. I almost DON'T want to put a review for fear of making this place a little too well known? But I have to say that this place is probably one of my most favorite bars in downtown NOLA. Bartenders are some of the best and friendliest around and the drink prices are second to none. If you go, try the Frozen Irish Coffee. Absolutely fantastic. To be honest, I can't think of a bad thing about that place. Love Molly's!"},{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","review_id":"RNIhHsXE7OuI0ZVX0-FPUg","date":"2010-11-27T23:46:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9388675689697266,"text_excerpt":"Molly's! Another can't-believe-I-haven't-reviewed and another Top 3 bar for me. When I lived near here, we would go several times a week, if only to stop in for a dangerously delicious Irish coffee drink. I don't know if you would get sick on booze or dairy first, but I would personally volunteer to find out and it would still be a good night. Great neighborhood vibe. Bartenders are no-nonsense and usually down to shoot the breeze. I love their jukebox, however, if I hear Flogging Molly more than five times a night I might personally rip the cord out the wall. The photobooth is a fun addition."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","photo_id":"j119pYmIkZ8lgYOErOp4Qw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/j119pYmIkZ8lgYOErOp4Qw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8945314288139343},{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","photo_id":"OBiEUhHNYMWKuqb6yPVDDQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/OBiEUhHNYMWKuqb6yPVDDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8742629885673523},{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","photo_id":"bEivRZTZg8W6YBCBhOQQ0Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/bEivRZTZg8W6YBCBhOQQ0Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.841029167175293},{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","photo_id":"J19GAEWyHDOf6_3QIiyKAA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/J19GAEWyHDOf6_3QIiyKAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8320410847663879},{"business_id":"YxzjYHBkWLwxpvOlcjKkhw","photo_id":"_71w53Tev5kX3PtOAeMSfA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_71w53Tev5kX3PtOAeMSfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.825791597366333}]},"notebook_case":null}
